// This file is the canonical key list. Every other <lang>.lproj/Localizable.strings
// must keep the keys in sync with this file. Missing keys fall back to the key
// itself at runtime, which makes regressions visible during QA.
//
// To add a new language: copy this file to <code>.lproj/Localizable.strings,
// translate the right-hand side of each line, and add <code> to LanguageCode in
// PrusaStatusBar/Services/Localization/LanguageCode.swift, plus
// CFBundleLocalizations in Info.plist and KNOWN_REGIONS in project.yml.
// See LOCALIZATION.md at the repo root for the full recipe.

